{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（26日）早上6時27分，打鼓嶺文錦渡路近馬會道發生車禍。據報有專線小巴撞向一部單車。人員接報到場時，騎單車的男子重傷昏迷，沒有呼吸脈膊，由救護車送往北區醫院搶救，惟至6時59分證實不治；小巴上一名女乘客亦受輕傷。</p><p>警方正封路調查事故。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事單車停在現場。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147087592647299072234910.jpeg/lPtvxXh2C5HrPyknFCnCuf-bV5dvFCtWUhtz9lIbc_Y\"/><figcaption>涉事單車停在現場。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小巴左邊車頭撞到單車，事後警方貼上黑膠袋。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147088187361857536056187.jpeg/U3ZvczA2fxweOc7roDi3309UoqJFh90ojR7lXY0e5V0\"/><figcaption>小巴左邊車頭撞到單車，事後警方貼上黑膠袋。</figcaption></figure><p>現場消息稱，小巴由文錦渡路往上水，至紅橋新村路口，單車由讓線左轉駛出，小巴收掣不及從後撞上。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方檢走涉事單車。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147091538291986432649215.jpeg/cJbZapKrr8F1dnSoPBdcWsaliKcEmmcw3MSigtzEooI\"/><figcaption>警方檢走涉事單車。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方檢事涉事小巴。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147090979623276544489153.jpeg/TEO6uFH4Y_4VDbGdRU3U6FgguwxVUUS31AZ0P9QGdD8\"/><figcaption>警方檢事涉事小巴。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是文錦渡路。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147093007275659264246193.jpeg/uGmbSHMiQok3nM1FBqEdJ-c1deThrdnSucLVbrnC1W4\"/><figcaption>現場是文錦渡路。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小巴倒後鏡損毀。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147093011017109504361579.jpeg/i2TZ6BqHidBo4GwAQtRAB64QTPCzQztfo6AjI6OgIyM\"/><figcaption>小巴倒後鏡損毀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方檢取事主的單車。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147093015261876224285109.jpeg/BG0t0jXzYXGmbTkLMOf0n_cD_Lj9ErldmCq8ZJgqvGQ\"/><figcaption>警方檢取事主的單車。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者被送到北區醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147077539844329472618395.jpeg/tA6U_a8C3bdfLc1RTTjqDEbrtPtqQyN66kT7mOpE-5g\"/><figcaption>傷者被送到北區醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-26T00:42:07.001298+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}